true] [17592186416506 1068 #edb/ref 17592186416503 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416506 1069 "q-148377" 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416506 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416506 1071 "| $f(x,y)$ | $Y=-4$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=2$ | ${f}_{X}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.16$ | $0.17$ | $0.19$ | $0.52$ |\n| $X=10$ | $0.15$ | $0.17$ | $0.16$ | $0.48$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}$ | $0.31$ | $0.34$ | $0.35$ | $1$ |\n\nThe joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is shown above. Given that \n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=4.8,\\,\\text{E}[Y]=-0.54,\\,\\text{SD}[X]≈4.9960,\\,\\text{SD}[Y]≈2.4634,\n$$\n\n \nfind the correlation coefficient of $X$ and $Y.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416506 1072 #uuid "71621138-ed93-53b4-9ace-266f4a0d5dab" 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416506 1074 "Recall that the correlation coefficient of random variables $X$ and $Y$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\rho =\\frac{\\text{Cov}[X,Y]}{\\text{SD}[X]\\cdot \\text{SD}[Y]},\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n- $\\text{Cov}[X,Y]$ is the covariance, and\n\n- $\\text{SD}[X]$ and $\\text{SD}[Y]$ are the standard deviations of $X$ and $Y.$\n\nFirst, by applying the rule of the lazy statistician, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[XY] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in {S}_{X}}{\\sum }_{y\\in {S}_{Y}}xy\\,f(x,y) \\\\  & =0\\cdot (-4)\\cdot 0.16+0\\cdot 0\\cdot 0.17+0\\cdot 2\\cdot 0.19 \\\\  & +10\\cdot (-4)\\cdot 0.15+10\\cdot 0\\cdot 0.17+10\\cdot 2\\cdot 0.16 \\\\  & =-2.8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute the covariance and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}[X,Y] & =\\text{E}[XY]-\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y] \\\\  & =-2.8-(4.8)(-0.54) \\\\  & =-0.208.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correlation coefficient is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\rho  & =\\frac{\\text{Cov}[X,Y]}{\\text{SD}[X]\\cdot \\text{SD}[Y]} \\\\  & ≈\\frac{-0.208}{4.9960\\cdot 2.4634} \\\\  & ≈-0.02,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to $2$ decimal places." 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416507 1062 #uuid "64154ed0-ecd2-5a93-a53c-c88a0fff494a" 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416507 1063 #edb/ref 17592186416506 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416508 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416509 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416508 1062 #uuid "a8c3d0f3-7ae4-57cd-aeb8-05d8cdcf0700" 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416508 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162442 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416509 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416507 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416509 1062 #uuid "c917e351-229c-5962-9db6-66543286f0e6" 13194139534262 17592186045417 true] [17592186416509 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162446 13194139534262 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-73500361-3c8f-52ce-8bc5-0eba17f74db0" 17592186416487 "answer-0876eb83-57bd-5e84-8477-dc5d60ce323d" 17592186416488 "answer-54445a12-3783-54c9-a829-54a3a211f3e3" 17592186416489 "answer-59e0c0fc-3c74-57a4-869c-4fa2f31bf145" 17592186416490 "answer-671ca342-974b-595d-90ce-f2d135a933c5" 17592186416491 "answer-6835da4f-0783-54f5-9112-499b793c7b69" 17592186416492 "answer-76b4ff69-0d3b-5cf8-8bc0-c37eb66140b2" 17592186416493 "answer-7d3b6071-447a-5e5b-955a-60e039ddb364" 17592186416494 "answer-8305d7f0-359a-5672-84b3-d2451cec6023" 17592186416495 "answer-84a27511-2f73-51ad-9efc-512adfb8573b" 17592186416496 "answer-90d7f216-f436-5ba1-90e3-d380e7bb6856" 17592186416497 "answer-92d2fd3c-8d02-57f3-80c7-ad19c8e18d56" 17592186416498 "answer-990379fa-9ca9-5e21-9b76-b06e960628cd" 17592186416499 "answer-c5c6d741-b8ea-5c6d-a797-e6668be9d1b6" 17592186416500 "answer-f032cbc3-7ec5-5ffd-9b44-86c708965b4f" 17592186416501 "answer-f2544fdb-11f6-5f6b-b648-844f55f4831f" 17592186416502 "answer-field-b3019da1-a157-5528-94a6-85caf91d61fd" 17592186416503 "answer-field-b7baad12-38b1-5f0c-9519-c9cab1926772" 17592186416504 "answer-field-fd07d7b1-6cdf-5103-98fc-8aa75014e305" 17592186